            "review_title": "Review at Mi Quang Pho Hoi",
            "review_text": "emsholm\nHolbaek, Denmark12 contributions\n0\nlocal great experience for locals - and the occasional traveller\nMar 2026 • Friends\nWhat a meal you get at this Vietnamese noodle soup place. One of the best mì Quảng đặc biệt with quail eggs we’ve had. Pleasant setting, reasonable prices, and even fresh local desserts.\n\nThe location is away from the tourist area, which makes it a great place to experience how local families live and work in today’s Saigon.\n\nKeep it up\nRead more\nWritten March 28, 2026",
            "rating": 5.0,
